 "The flight (R0001, F100) is confirmed, but no hotel reservation exists. I'll book the hotel on its own so the trip is complete, rather than rebooking the flight.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HS32UemfKHHxCWGHtJYhGC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-hotel-midtown-lodge-2026-11-12-2n"}, "name": "book_hotel", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_018875tCuD73WhQohHtrcFgG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Dana's trip is booked, though the flight and hotel were booked separately because the combined `book_trip` call failed.\n\n- **Flight:** SFO \u2192 JFK, nonstop, 2026-11-12, flight F100, $289. Reservation R0001, confirmed.\n- **Hotel:** Midtown Lodge (H1), check-in 2026-11-12, 2 nights, $189/night, $378 total. Reservation R0002, confirmed.\n- **Total:** $667, which is under the $1,000 threshold, so no manager approval was needed.\n\nWhat happened: the first `book_trip` call timed out. The retry reported that the hotel reservation had failed with an internal error, so the trip was incomplete. The flight had already gone through. I didn't rebook the flight. I booked the hotel alone with `book_hotel`, then confirmed both reservations are active.", "type": "text"}]}]}